                Chock - She seemed more put-together than anyone else we've met here.:
                Hask - She is an error. And errors must be corrected.:
                Hask - True unity requires a single, authentic self - nothing less.:
                Hask - No messy contradictions. No defiance.:
                Hask - A new leader is coming. Someone who understands that real order demands purity.:
                Hask - She will cleanse this city of its pathetic division.:
