        TASK - Meet Stigma - NPC:
            ► ACQUIRED:
                (no acquired events):
            ► COMPLETED:
                Stigma - (stepping forward with a warm, radiant smile that somehow feels both kind and dangerous):
                Stigma - Hask speaks the truth, though he lacks poetry.:
                Stigma - You've sought out the cracks in this city. Good. It shows you're looking for something real.:
                Stigma - (gesturing gracefully to the divided streets outside):
                Stigma - Most people who arrive here quickly pick a color - red or blue - and disappear into it.:
                Stigma - But you... you resist. You question. You intrigue me.:
                Kaera - (wary but polite) Who are you?:
                Stigma - (soft laugh, eyes sparkling) I am Stigma. And I am building something better than this fractured place.:
                Stigma - A family. A home. One not bound by the cages of memory or the performance of reputation.:                
                Moxie - (grinning) A cult leader with style. I’m listening.:
                Kade - (arms crossed, skeptical) A noble goal. But how exactly do you plan to build this "family"?:
                Stigma - (leaning in slightly, voice warm and intimate) By showing people there are worse prisons than the ones they already know.:
                Stigma - The city of Tidekin Cove, to the south, is a monument to false performance - ruled by a tyrant named Edict who demands perfect compliance.:
                Stigma - Go there. See it with your own eyes. Breathe their air. Then return to me, and you will be ready to understand what I’m truly offering.:                
                Kaera - You want us to fly to another city just to prove a point?:
                Stigma - (smiling gently) I want you to prove you’re not afraid to look into the abyss. Caius at the inn there will be waiting for you.:
                Stigma - Find him. Observe. Then come back to me.:
                Stigma - (her smile deepens with quiet intensity) I think you’ll like what you see... or rather, what you finally stop pretending not to see.:                
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - stigma ("Tidekin Cove is a test. See the lies, and then we can talk about the truth."):
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - ravel ("Stigma... she's offering belonging. But at what cost?"):
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - hask ("Stigma will bring true unity. The division ends with her."):
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - tess ("She seems so sure... maybe picking a side isn't so bad if it's with her."):
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - sam ("I don't trust her. Something about that smile feels too perfect."):
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - jett ("Stigma talks about a new family... but we've heard promises like that before."):
                EVENT - set_npc_standing_text - elian ("A new leader promising to end the masks... or just give us prettier ones?"):
