            ► COMPLETED:
                Caius - You came back? Are you insane? Stigma’s 'great cleansing' is a massacre in the making.:
                Caius - She’s not saving this city - she’s going to burn it down and rebuild it in her image.
                Caius - She talks about family and freedom, but she’s just collecting broken people. Edict is cold and controlling...:
                Caius - but at least his rules are honest. Stigma gets inside your head.:
                Moxie - So we’ve been played.:
                Kaera - Then the real enemy might not be Edict alone.:
                Caius - If you want to stop this before it explodes, you need to reach Edict.:
                Caius - But he’s locked in the Citadel. The only one who can get you close is Pageant - her master of ceremonies.:
