        TASK - Meet Ravel For Warden Hale:
            ► ACQUIRED:
                (no acquired events):
            ► COMPLETED:
                Ravel - You broke Pageant's stage... you actually broke it. I never thought I'd see the day.:
                Ravel - You're not just fighting the masks. You're fighting the whole rotten system. But there are others... others who resisted long before I did.:
                Kaera - Who? We need to find anyone who stands against Edict.:
                Ravel - Warden Hale. He was a keeper of the old ways, a man who believed in duty and memory, not performance.:
                Ravel - Edict couldn't stand him. Hale was a living reminder that this city had a soul before it had a script.:
                Ravel - So Edict locked him away. Made an example of him.:
                Poise - A man who values duty over performance. Where is he?:
                Ravel - I don't know. The prison is a black site. But Jett... Jett, in the Heap. They see everything the Citadel throws away.:
                Ravel - If anyone knows where Edict hides his inconvenient truths, it's them.:
