            ► ACQUIRED:
                (no acquired events):
            ► COMPLETED:
                Elian - You're looking for Warden Hale? You're trying to pull a memory from a city that burns them?:
                Elian - I hear whispers... The guards from the prison, they come here to drink.:
                Elian - They talk about their warden, a man named Hask. He's the key.:
                Moxie - Hask? The walking rulebook we met earlier? He's not going to just tell us where the prison is.:
                Elian - No. But he's proud. He's a true believer in Edict's system. He sees dissent as a personal insult.:
                Elian - He despises Ravel. He thinks her defiance is a stain on the city's perfection.:
                Elian - If you go to him... and you praise her... praise her strength, her wholeness... it will break his composure.:
                Elian - His pride will make him boast about the place where such 'errors' are corrected.:
