        TASK - Meet Hask for Warden Hale:
            ► ACQUIRED:
                (no acquired events):
            ► COMPLETED:
                Hask - (eyes narrow as you approach) You again. Still consorting with the city's cracks?:
                Kaera - We spoke with Ravel. She has a strength you don't see often here. A wholeness.:
                Hask - 'Wholeness'? She is a flaw. A chaotic variable in a perfect equation. Her 'strength' is a disease.:
                Chock - She stands for something real. Unlike the puppets in this city.:
